{"direction":"id-en","id":"scientific-abstract","source":"Penelitian ini menilai hubungan antara paparan partikulat halus dan rawat inap. Analisis mencakup 240 peserta yang diikuti selama 12 bulan. Meskipun rasio risiko yang disesuaikan adalah 1.20, interval kepercayaan mencakup nilai nol. Temuan ini tidak membuktikan hubungan sebab akibat dan harus ditafsirkan secara hati-hati.","result":{"text":"This study assessed the relationship between exposure to delicate party and intrusive care. Analysis includes 240 participants followed during 12 months. While the adjusted risk ratio is 1.20, confidence interval includes zero. This find doesn't prove cause-cause-effect relationship and should be interpreted carefully.","status":"translated","outcome":"translated","retryable":false,"issues":[],"engine":{"direction":"id-en","fingerprint":"eb4722cead56364538c05a99f6a08a65a7a6bb8ac7e6a49b9ce4adf0858889db|ordered-xml-literals-v11-dash-separators-math-phrases-v12-contextual-concepts|preserve-v2|cp18-marker-boundaries-v1","runtime":"onnxruntime-web 1.23.2 / WASM, 1 thread","model":"opus-id-en-2019-12-18-onnx-q8-per-channel","maxInputTokens":128,"maxOutputTokens":256,"offlineReady":true,"storageMode":"persistent","storageWarning":"","supportsAbort":"worker termination","supportsGlossaryConstraints":false,"requiresNetworkForInference":false},"inputTokens":73,"outputTokens":78,"method":"local-model-with-protected-spans","semanticVerified":false},"elapsedMs":2412.987208999999}
